    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DepthMera</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A thrilling 2D platform shooter with Rogue-like elements, <i>DepthMera</i> offers a unique blend of action and storytelling, reminiscent of <i>The Binding of Isaac</i> and <i>Rogue Legacy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a world where each level brings new challenges and rewards. Your journey is driven by the task of collecting symbolic pictures of self-discovery and growth. These pictures not only shape your character\u2019s story but also transform your eerie, desolate house into a vibrant, welcoming home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Gameplay:</strong> Randomly generated levels ensure no two runs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Abilities:</strong> Discover a variety of items that grant special powers to enhance your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> Test your skills against powerful and challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Transformative Narrative:</strong> Collect pictures that evolve the world around you, turning darkness into light.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on this emotional and action-packed adventure where every step you take brings you closer to building a better world. Are you ready to rewrite your story?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DepthMera</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A thrilling 2D platform shooter with Rogue-like elements, <i>DepthMera</i> offers a unique blend of action and storytelling, reminiscent of <i>The Binding of Isaac</i> and <i>Rogue Legacy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a world where each level brings new challenges and rewards. Your journey is driven by the task of collecting symbolic pictures of self-discovery and growth. These pictures not only shape your character\u2019s story but also transform your eerie, desolate house into a vibrant, welcoming home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Gameplay:</strong> Randomly generated levels ensure no two runs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Abilities:</strong> Discover a variety of items that grant special powers to enhance your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> Test your skills against powerful and challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Transformative Narrative:</strong> Collect pictures that evolve the world around you, turning darkness into light.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on this emotional and action-packed adventure where every step you take brings you closer to building a better world. Are you ready to rewrite your story?</p>",
